  "body": "Split from #1240 (PR #1243 delivered the migration guide page; this second part wasn't in it).\n\n**What:** the docs site needs `camcraft-cli` examples for a user moving from another CAM system: importing a tool library and a model, posting a program headlessly, with each command's exit codes. Every example must be run against the current build and copied from real output, not written from memory.\n\n**Done means:** a guide section (or page) with those examples, each verified against main's `camcraft-cli`, linked from site/content/guide/migrating.md.\n",
